      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-24T22:37:34.476+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Ah I see you did more than just connect all the ends, also shortened all the resistors (and in particular the one on the right).  Though is it shortened by enough?  Eyeballing it looks like it's about 1/3rd of the length of the original resistors and there were originally ~7 and 2/3 of them",
      "author": {
        "id": "691780627338625077",
        "name": "rebelmike",
        "discriminator": "0000",
        "nickname": "RebelMike",
        "color": null,
        "isBot": false,
        "roles": [],
        "avatarUrl": "2026-11_media/49aaff687e56f04e7bbdedf0077bab75-7DDB4.png"
